#~ "set this option you must also set the applications to use the IMAP "
#~ "resource; this is done in the KDE System Settings.</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>Omogućavanje ovog čini da se unosi iz programa zbirke Kontact "
#~ "(KOrganizer, KAddressBook (Adresar) i KNotes) snimaju.</p><p>Ako želite "
#~ "podesiti tu opciju, morate takođe podesiti programe, da koriste IMAP "
#~ "resurse. To se radi u KDE sistemskim postavkama.</p>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>Usually you will not have any reason to see the folders that hold the "
#~ "IMAP resources. But if you need to see them, you can set that here.</p>"
